-------------------------
The runtime and Future Perfect target are based on nemonicicon/ts3FPrecomp at
d90c92988a9f99d0580d2ca3f7efd6ec3a7b7845:
https://github.com/nemonicicon/ts3FPrecomp/tree/d90c92988a9f99d0580d2ca3f7efd6ec3a7b7845

Its GPL-3.0 license, original xboxrecomp MIT notice, third-party attribution,
