Those components retain their original notices and licenses; this project does
not replace them or claim their authorship. See LICENSES/README.md for details.
The complete pristine runtime source at that revision is also preserved under
vendor/ts3FPrecomp/source and reconstructed locally by tools/prepare-runtime.py.

Launcher/game icon lettering attribution remains in
tools/launcher/GameMonogram.NOTICE.txt. External dependencies, including SDL,
FFmpeg, Python/Tcl/Tk and bundled Online dependencies, retain their own terms.
Keep the applicable license and attribution files with redistributed code and
builds. Public game packages include them in Licenses and Support.

The project-owned XBE reader uses the CC0-1.0 kernel export declarations from
